{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"2b8d0884ff2f61cf","__entryId":"json","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <span>Headers</span><span style=\"color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">Preview</span><span>Response</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:var(--text)\">\n        ▾ <b>data</b>: {…}<br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:18px\">▾ <b>list</b>: [3]</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:36px\">▾ <b>0</b>: {name: \"按钮 Button\", price: 0}</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:36px\">▾ <b>1</b>: {name: \"输入框 Input\", price: 0}</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:36px\">▸ <b>2</b>: {…}</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:18px\"><b>total</b>: 42</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">Preview 帮你把 JSON 排成可折叠的树</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n      <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px\">data.json</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">{</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"site\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"Vibe 图鉴\"</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"stats\"</span>: {</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"components\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">48</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"online\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#f38ba8\">true</span></div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;},</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"tags\"</span>: [<span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"通用\"</span>, <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"表单\"</span>]</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">}</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;padding:12px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n        <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;{</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"name\": \"按钮\",</div>\n        <div style=\"background:rgba(245,63,63,.18);color:#f38ba8\">3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"tags\": [\"通用\",],</div>\n        <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\">4&nbsp;&nbsp;}</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--red-light);border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">\n        ✕ 第 3 行：数组最后一项后面多了逗号\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n      <div style=\"color:#a6d189\">$ curl -s https://api.vibeui.dev/user/1 | jq</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">{</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"id\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">1</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"name\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"林小狐\"</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"roles\"</span>: [</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"admin\"</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"editor\"</span></div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;]</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">}</div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\"># jq 将压缩 JSON 格式化为带缩进的结构</div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <span>Headers</span><span style=\"color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">Preview</span><span>Response</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:var(--text)\">\n        ▾ <b>data</b>: {…}<br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:18px\">▾ <b>list</b>: [3]</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:36px\">▾ <b>0</b>: {name: \"Button\", price: 0}</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:36px\">▾ <b>1</b>: {name: \"Text input\", price: 0}</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:36px\">▸ <b>2</b>: {…}</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:18px\"><b>total</b>: 42</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">Preview helps you arrange JSON into a collapsible tree</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n      <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px\">data.json</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">{</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"site\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"Vibe Picture Book\"</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"stats\"</span>: {</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"components\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">48</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"online\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#f38ba8\">true</span></div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> },</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"tags\"</span>: [<span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"General\"</span>, <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"Form\"</span>]</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">}</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;padding:12px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n        <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\">1 {</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">2 \"name\": \"Button\",</div>\n        <div style=\"background:rgba(245,63,63,.18);color:#f38ba8\">3 \"tags\": [\"Universal\",],</div>\n        <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\">4 }</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--red-light);border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">\n        ✕ Line 3: There is an extra comma after the last item in the array\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n      <div style=\"color:#a6d189\">$ curl -s https://api.vibeui.dev/user/1 | jq</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">{</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"id\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">1</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"name\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"Alex Chen\"</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"roles\"</span>: [</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"admin\"</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"editor\"</span></div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> ]</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">}</div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\"># jq Format compressed JSON into an indented structure</div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"json-anat\"><pre><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"object\"><span class=\"json-p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"ap json-k\" data-ap=\"key\">\"tags\"</span><span class=\"json-p\">:</span> <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"array\"><span class=\"json-p\">[</span><span class=\"ap json-s\" data-ap=\"value\">\"通用\"</span><span class=\"json-p\">,</span> <span class=\"json-s\">\"表单\"</span><span class=\"json-p\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"json-p\">}</span></span></pre></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"json-anat\"><pre><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"object\"><span class=\"json-p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"ap json-k\" data-ap=\"key\">\"tags\"</span><span class=\"json-p\">:</span> <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"array\"><span class=\"json-p\">[</span><span class=\"ap json-s\" data-ap=\"value\">\"Universal\"</span><span class=\"json-p\">,</span> <span class=\"json-s\">\"form\"</span><span class=\"json-p\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"json-p\">}</span></span></pre></span>","parts":[{"key":"object","cn":"对象","en":"Object","desc":"一对花括号包起来的整体，描述「一个东西」","desc_en":"A pair of curly brackets enclosing the whole, describing \"a thing\""},{"key":"key","cn":"键","en":"Key","desc":"冒号左边的名字，必须双引号","desc_en":"The name to the left of the colon must be in double quotes"},{"key":"array","cn":"数组","en":"Array","desc":"方括号包起来的有序列表，渲染 {c:list} 就靠它","desc_en":"An ordered list enclosed in square brackets, which is used to render {c:list}"},{"key":"value","cn":"值","en":"Value","desc":"冒号右边的内容：字符串、数字、布尔、对象、数组","desc_en":"The content on the right side of the colon: string, number, Boolean, object, array"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"对象","en":"Object","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\">{ \"name\": \"按钮\", \"price\": 0 }</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\">{ \"name\": \"button\", \"price\": 0 }</span>","when":"花括号包键值对，描述一个东西","when_en":"Curly braces enclose key-value pairs to describe something"},{"cn":"数组","en":"Array","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\">[ \"通用\", \"表单\", \"反馈\" ]</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\">[ \"General\", \"Form\", \"Feedback\" ]</span>","when":"方括号包列表，顺序有意义","when_en":"Square brackets enclose the list, the order is meaningful"},{"cn":"嵌套","en":"Nested","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\">{ \"user\": { \"roles\": […] } }</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\">{ \"user\": { \"roles\": […] } }</span>","when":"对象套数组，真实数据都这样","when_en":"Objects are arrays, and real data is like this"}],"use":[{"t":"拿到 {c:api} 返回<b>先整体看结构</b>，再决定取哪层","m":"json-structure"},{"t":"数组是<b>有序值列表</b>，常可循环渲染成 {c:list}；先确认每项结构是否一致","m":"json-array"},{"t":"嵌套就<b>一层层往里取</b>：data.user.name","m":"json-nested"},{"t":"压缩后的内容难以阅读时，可用<b>可信的格式化工具</b>增加缩进；敏感数据不要粘贴到未知网站","m":"json-format"}],"dont":[{"t":"键名<b>忘加双引号</b>：JS 行，JSON 不行","m":"json-quote","bad":true},{"t":"最后一项后面<b>多一个逗号</b>：解析直接报错","m":"json-comma","bad":true},{"t":"用<b>单引号</b>包字符串：JSON 只认双引号","m":"json-single","bad":true},{"t":"按 JavaScript 对象的写法加入<b>注释</b>：标准 JSON 不支持注释","m":"json-comment","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"接口返回 {\"items\":[{\"name\":\"A\"}]}，页面却读取 data.list 并报错。应该先怎样修？","options":[{"id":"match-structure","label":"按实际 JSON 结构读取 items，并检查每项需要的字段","feedback":"页面读取路径必须与收到的对象和数组层级一致；继续使用前还要确认字段是否齐全。","correct":true},{"id":"change-quotes","label":"把返回内容里的双引号换成单引号，再读取 data.list","feedback":"标准 JSON 字符串使用双引号，而且换引号不会把 items 字段变成 list。","correct":false},{"id":"hide-parse-error","label":"捕获错误后返回空列表，不再查看接口内容","feedback":"页面不会崩溃，但真实数据也被丢掉；应先对齐数据结构，再决定缺失时的降级状态。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"An API returns {\"items\":[{\"name\":\"A\"}]}, but the page reads data.list and fails. What should be fixed first?","options":[{"id":"match-structure","label":"Read items from the actual JSON shape and verify each required field","feedback":"The access path must match the received object and array levels, and required item fields still need validation.","correct":true},{"id":"change-quotes","label":"Replace double quotes with single quotes and keep reading data.list","feedback":"Standard JSON uses double quotes, and changing quote style would not rename the items field to list.","correct":false},{"id":"hide-parse-error","label":"Catch the error, return an empty list, and stop inspecting the response","feedback":"The crash disappears but valid data is discarded. Align the structure before choosing an empty-state fallback.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"接口实际返回 items 数组，但页面读取 data.list。请先对齐真实 JSON 层级，再检查每项需要的字段；缺失或格式错误时显示明确失败状态，不要静默变成空列表。请用正常、缺字段和无效 JSON 三种输入验证。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"The API returns an items array while the page reads data.list. Align the code with the actual JSON shape and validate required item fields. Show a clear failure for missing or invalid data instead of silently returning an empty list. Test valid, missing-field, and invalid JSON inputs."}},"references":[{"title":"使用 JSON 数据","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Scripting/JSON","title_en":"Working with JSON"}],"scenes":["Network 面板看返回","编辑器里的 data.json","JSON 校验报错","终端 jq 美化输出"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"API request and response","m":"json-structure"},{"t":"Configuration file","m":"json-array"},{"t":"Store structured data temporarily","m":"json-nested"},{"t":"Exchange nested values between systems","m":"json-format"}],"dont":[{"t":"Add comments or trailing commas where strict JSON is required","m":"json-quote","bad":true},{"t":"Assume parsed JSON has the correct fields","m":"json-comma","bad":true},{"t":"Use JSON for a large binary file","m":"json-single","bad":true},{"t":"Expose secret data just because the format is readable","m":"json-comment","bad":true}],"scenes":["API response","Configuration","Webhook payload","Exported data"],"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <span>Headers</span><span style=\"color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">Preview</span><span>Response</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:var(--text)\">\n        ▾ <b>data</b>: {…}<br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:18px\">▾ <b>list</b>: [3]</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:36px\">▾ <b>0</b>: {name: \"Button\", price: 0}</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:36px\">▾ <b>1</b>: {name: \"Text input\", price: 0}</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:36px\">▸ <b>2</b>: {…}</span><br>\n        <span style=\"padding-left:18px\"><b>total</b>: 42</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">Preview helps you arrange JSON into a collapsible tree</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n      <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px\">data.json</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">{</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"site\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"Vibe Picture Book\"</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"stats\"</span>: {</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"components\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">48</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"online\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#f38ba8\">true</span></div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> },</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"tags\"</span>: [<span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"General\"</span>, <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"Form\"</span>]</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">}</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;padding:12px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n        <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\">1 {</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">2 \"name\": \"Button\",</div>\n        <div style=\"background:rgba(245,63,63,.18);color:#f38ba8\">3 \"tags\": [\"Universal\",],</div>\n        <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\">4 }</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--red-light);border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">\n        ✕ Line 3: There is an extra comma after the last item in the array\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:#1d2129;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9\">\n      <div style=\"color:#a6d189\">$ curl -s https://api.vibeui.dev/user/1 | jq</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">{</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"id\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">1</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"name\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"Alex Chen\"</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"roles\"</span>: [</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"admin\"</span>,</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> <span style=\"color:#a6d189\">\"editor\"</span></div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\"> ]</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9cdd4\">}</div>\n      <div style=\"color:var(--code-muted)\"># jq Format compressed JSON into an indented structure</div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\">{ \"name\": \"button\", \"price\": 0 }</span>","when":"Curly braces enclose key-value pairs to describe something"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\">[ \"General\", \"Form\", \"Feedback\" ]</span>","when":"Square brackets enclose the list, the order is meaningful"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px\">{ \"user\": { \"roles\": […] } }</span>","when":"Objects are arrays, and real data is like this"}]},"usageMocks":{"json-structure":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"background:#1d2129;border-color:#1d2129\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:#c9cdd4\">{ <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"data\"</span>: { <span style=\"color:#7db3ff\">\"list\"</span>: [ … ] } }</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--code-muted)\">先确认整体结构，再按层级读取字段</span></div>","json-array":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">[</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">{…}</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">\"文本\"</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">42</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">]</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">有序 JSON 值列表；是否同构要看接口约定</span></div>","json-nested":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">data</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">user</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag green\">name</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">嵌套字段需要按层级读取</span></div>","json-format":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag gray\" style=\"font-family:monospace\">{\"a\":1,\"b\":[2,3]}</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag green\">格式化</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">格式化会加入缩进，便于检查层级</span>","json-quote":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"background:#1d2129;border-color:#1d2129\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:#c9cdd4\">{ <span style=\"color:#f38ba8\">name</span>: \"小林\" }</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f38ba8\">键名缺少双引号，无法按 JSON 解析</span></div>","json-comma":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"background:#1d2129;border-color:#1d2129\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:#c9cdd4\">[ \"a\", \"b\"<span style=\"color:#f38ba8\">,</span> ]</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f38ba8\">JSON 不允许最后一项后保留尾随逗号</span></div>","json-single":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"background:#1d2129;border-color:#1d2129\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:#c9cdd4\">{ <span style=\"color:#f38ba8\">'name'</span>: '小林' }</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f38ba8\">JSON 的键和字符串必须使用双引号</span></div>","json-comment":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"background:#1d2129;border-color:#1d2129\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:#c9cdd4\">{ <span style=\"color:#f38ba8\">// 注释</span> \"a\": 1 }</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f38ba8\">JSON 不支持注释</span></div>"}}}